---
import '../styles/focus.css';
---

<section id="focus" class="current-focus section section--dark">
  <div class="container current-focus__inner">
    <div class="current-focus__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Current Focus</p>

      <h2>
        AI is only one part <span>of the system.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="lead">
        My current work explores how real-time voice, open-weight models,
        dedicated inference hardware, orchestration, tools, memory, and
        application logic fit together to create useful AI systems.
      </p>

      <p class="current-focus__secondary">
        The interesting problems are rarely just about choosing a model.
        They’re about everything around it: latency, context, routing,
        reliability, interfaces, and deciding what should happen where.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="current-focus__system" aria-label="Simplified AI system architecture">
      <div class="focus-node focus-node--voice">
        <span class="focus-node__index">01</span>
        <strong>Input</strong>
        <small>Telephone audio or realtime text enters the system</small>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-link" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-node focus-node--speech">
        <span class="focus-node__index">02</span>
        <strong>Data</strong>
        <small>Audio processing, transcription and data acquisition</small>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-link" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-node focus-node--orchestration">
        <span class="focus-node__index">03</span>
        <strong>Orchestration</strong>
        <small>Context, state, tools, longterm strategy, and immediate routing</small>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-link" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-node focus-node--model">
        <span class="focus-node__index">04</span>
        <strong>Processing</strong>
        <small>Inference or code executes on local hardware</small>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-link" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="focus-node focus-node--response">
        <span class="focus-node__index">05</span>
        <strong>Response</strong>
        <small>Useful output returned as text or streaming audio</small>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="current-focus__aside">
      <span>TOOLS</span>
      <span>MEMORY</span>
      <span>RETRIEVAL</span>
      <span>APPLICATION LOGIC</span>
      <span>LOCAL INFERENCE</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>